<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?> <?xml-stylesheet type="text/xsl" href="rss.xsl"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"> <channel> <title>SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</title><description>SONiC NOS（sonic-net/SONiC）の日本語非公式ドキュメント</description><link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/</link><atom:link href="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml" /> <docs>https://github.com/aoki-taquan/sonic-unofficial-docs</docs><language>ja</language> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 04:44:53 -0000</pubDate> <lastBuildDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 04:44:53 -0000</lastBuildDate> <ttl>1440</ttl> <generator>MkDocs RSS plugin - v1.19.0</generator> <image> <url>None</url> <title>SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</title> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/</link> </image> <item> <title>変更履歴</title> <category>changelog</category> <category>meta</category> <description>変更履歴 — このページは merged PR のメタデータから meta/scripts/gen_changelog.py で機械生成されています。手で編集しないでください。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/changelog/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 04:42:54 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/changelog/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/_meta/changelog.png" type="image/png" length="19713" /> </item> <item> <title>カバレッジ</title> <description>カバレッジ — このページは docs/**/*.md の frontmatter verification フィールドを集計したものです。meta/scripts/gen_coverage.py で自動生成されます。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/coverage/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 04:42:54 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/coverage/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/_meta/coverage.png" type="image/png" length="23000" /> </item> <item> <title>サイトマップ</title> <category>meta</category> <category>sitemap</category> <description>サイトマップ — docs/**/*.md を mkdocs nav 順で階層列挙したインデックス（全 1098 ページ）。meta/scripts/gen_sitemap.py で自動生成。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/sitemap/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 04:42:54 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/sitemap/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/_meta/sitemap.png" type="image/png" length="22774" /> </item> <item> <title>スナップショット</title> <description>&lt;h1&gt;スナップショット&lt;/h1&gt; &lt;p&gt;リポジトリ全体の状態を 1 ページに集約した自動生成サマリ。個別の詳細は &lt;code&gt;coverage.md&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;sitemap.md&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;discrepancies.md&lt;/code&gt; を参照。&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;!!! note &#34;生成元&#34; `python3 meta/scripts/gen_snapsho...&lt;/p&gt;</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/snapshot/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 04:42:54 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/_meta/snapshot/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/_meta/snapshot.png" type="image/png" length="16430" /> </item> <item> <title>Port Access Control（PAC: 802.1x / MAB / RADIUS）</title> <description>Port Access Control（PAC: 802.1x / MAB / RADIUS） — 物理ポート単位の クライアント認証 （IEEE 802.1x + MAB）を SONiC に持ち込む機能。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/acl-qos/port-access-control-in-sonic/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 04:42:54 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/acl-qos/port-access-control-in-sonic/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/acl-qos/port-access-control-in-sonic.png" type="image/png" length="63286" /> </item> <item> <title>sFlow テストプラン（hsflowd + 2 collector / sampling rate / agent-id / counter polling）</title> <description>sFlow テストプラン（hsflowd + 2 collector / sampling rate / agent-id / counter polling） — T0 上で SONiC sFlow 機能を機能検証するテスト。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/sflow-test-plan/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 04:42:54 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/sflow-test-plan/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/sflow-test-plan.png" type="image/png" length="45894" /> </item> <item> <title>SmartSwitch HA HAMgrD 概念（actor model と vDPU 抽象）</title> <description>HAMgrD の概念。NPU 側 actor model、vDPU 抽象、HA Set / HA Scope の役割、DPU-Driven / Switch-Driven mode の違いを整理する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design-concepts/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 04:42:54 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design-concepts/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/smartswitch-high-availability-manager-daemon-hamgrd-design-concepts.png" type="image/png" length="57541" /> </item> <item> <title>初学者向けガイド</title> <description>SONiC を初めて触る読者向け。コンテナ / Redis DB / SAI / 設定反映フローの輪郭と、各 area への導線をまとめます。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/guides/beginner/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 04:42:54 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/guides/beginner/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/guides/beginner.png" type="image/png" length="17930" /> </item> <item> <title>運用者向けガイド</title> <description>運用者向けガイド — 既に SONiC を運用している読者を想定した入口。日々の確認、設定変更、障害調査、CONFIG_DB の意味確認、show techsupport やログ・ヘルスチェックの使い方に加え、症状別の逆引き表をインラインで提供します。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/guides/operator/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 04:42:54 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/guides/operator/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/guides/operator.png" type="image/png" length="19962" /> </item> <item> <title>P4Orch（PINS の P4Runtime 用 orchagent / 同期書き込み）</title> <description>P4Orch は PINS (P4 Integrated Network Stack) の中核 orchagent。APPL_DB.P4RT を購読し、SAI を同期書き込みで叩いて P4Runtime controller に完了応答を返す。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/internals/p4-orchagent/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 04:42:54 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/internals/p4-orchagent/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/internals/p4-orchagent.png" type="image/png" length="56104" /> </item> <item> <title>用語集 (Glossary)</title> <description>用語集 (Glossary) — SONiC NOS で頻出する固有用語・略語・コンポーネント名・データベース名・デーモン名を、アルファベット順に整理した日本語用語集です。各エントリは「用語 / 略称 / 日本語訳 / 簡潔な説明 / 関連ページ」の形式で記載しています。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 04:42:54 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/glossary.png" type="image/png" length="30026" /> </item> <item> <title>PORT_STORM_CONTROL テーブル</title> <description>PORT_STORM_CONTROL テーブル — 物理ポートで BUM (broadcast / unknown-unicast / unknown-multicast) トラフィックのレート制限 (storm control) を設定するテーブル。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/port-storm-control/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 04:42:54 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/port-storm-control/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/port-storm-control.png" type="image/png" length="37884" /> </item> <item> <title>SYSLOG_CONFIG_FEATURE テーブル</title> <description>SYSLOG_CONFIG_FEATURE テーブル — SYSLOG_CONFIG.GLOBAL の rate-limit を FEATURE (docker) ごとに上書きするテーブル。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/syslog-config-feature/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 04:42:54 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/syslog-config-feature/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/syslog-config-feature.png" type="image/png" length="34832" /> </item> <item> <title>Routing loop が発生している</title> <description>Runbook: traceroute が同一 hop を繰り返し、TTL exceeded と control plane CPU が急上昇する routing loop の切り分けと対処手順。FRR zebra RIB / sonic-swss routeorch を根拠に static / BGP 経路の競合を診断する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/routing-loop-detected/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 04:42:54 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/runbooks/routing-loop-detected/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/runbooks/routing-loop-detected.png" type="image/png" length="33555" /> </item> <item> <title>NEXT_HOP_GROUP_TABLE による APP_DB ルートとネクストホップ分離</title> <description>NEXT_HOP_GROUP_TABLE による APP_DB ルートとネクストホップ分離 — 従来の SONiC は APP_DB.ROUTE_TABLE 各エントリにネクストホップ情報 (nexthop / ifname) を 直接埋め込んで いた。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/routing/routing-and-next-hop-table-enhancement/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 04:42:54 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/routing/routing-and-next-hop-table-enhancement/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/routing/routing-and-next-hop-table-enhancement.png" type="image/png" length="41349" /> </item> <item> <title>VRF サポート（vrfmgrd / vrforch / FRR vrf-aware）</title> <description>SONiC の VRF サポートは、Linux kernel の VRF master device を基盤に、FRR (zebra / bgpd) を vrf-aware 化し、SONiC 側に vrfmgrd / vrforch を新設して L3 interface・static route・BGP セッション・ACL redirect の VRF binding を一気通貫で扱う。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/routing/sonic-vrf-support-design-spec-draft/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 04:42:54 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/routing/sonic-vrf-support-design-spec-draft/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/routing/sonic-vrf-support-design-spec-draft.png" type="image/png" length="56827" /> </item> <item> <title>MCLAG Enhancements 概念（7 軸拡張・isolation group / unique IP）</title> <description>MCLAG Enhancements の概念整理。dynamic config / timer 設定 / static MAC / aging disable / MAC sync 最適化 / isolation group / unique IP の 7 軸を要件・ユースケースの観点で解説する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/switching/mclag-enhancements-concepts/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 04:42:54 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/switching/mclag-enhancements-concepts/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/switching/mclag-enhancements-concepts.png" type="image/png" length="56366" /> </item> <item> <title>System Ready（sysmonitor + per-app closest UP status の event 集約）</title> <description>System Ready — SONiC の起動は非同期で、systemd の service が active でも内部の SWSS 系 daemon が CONFIG_DB を消化し ASIC に届くまで時間が掛かるため、sysmonitor が closest UP status を集約して 1 つの ready 状態を公開する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/system/system-ready-hld/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 04:42:54 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/system/system-ready-hld/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/system/system-ready-hld.png" type="image/png" length="59297" /> </item> <item> <title>VXLAN / EVPN / VNET オーバーレイ</title> <description>VXLAN / EVPN / VNET オーバーレイ — この章は、SONiC の overlay を「VXLAN tunnel を作る」「VNET と VRF/VNI を対応させる」「EVPN やコントローラから経路を入れる」「運用中に ECMP、BFD、QoS を確認する」という読者の順番で読み直す入口です。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/03-vxlan-evpn/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 04:42:54 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/03-vxlan-evpn/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/03-vxlan-evpn/index.png" type="image/png" length="38142" /> </item> <item> <title>Overlay 運用</title> <description>SONiC で VXLAN / EVPN / VNET 由来の overlay 障害を underlay、VTEP、control plane、route programming、QoS / hash の順に切り分けるための運用ノート。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/03-vxlan-evpn/operations/</link> <pubDate>Sat, 06 Jun 2026 04:42:54 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/topics/03-vxlan-evpn/operations/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/topics/03-vxlan-evpn/operations.png" type="image/png" length="34012" /> </item> </channel> </rss>